<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Email Verification OTP</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f8;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #333;
        }

        .container {
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 30px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        h2 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        p {
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .otp-box {
            background-color: #f0f7ff;
            /* Soft blue background */
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px dashed #b3d4fc;
        }

        .otp-code {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #2980b9;
            /* Trustworthy blue instead of alert red */
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        .warning {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #7f8c8d;
            margin-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            padding-top: 15px;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Welcome, <%= name %>!</h2>
        <p>
            Thank you for registering with the Rental House Management System. To complete your account setup and gain
            full access to the platform, we just need to verify your email address.
        </p>

        <p>Please use the following One-Time Password (OTP) to verify your email. <strong>This code is valid for the
                next 15 minutes.</strong></p>

        <div class="otp-box">
            <p style="margin: 0; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase;">Your Verification OTP is:
            </p>
            <div class="otp-code">
                <%= otp %>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="warning">
            <p><strong>Didn't sign up for an account?</strong></p>
            <p>If you did not register for a Rental House Management System account, please ignore this email. No
                account will be created without this verification step.</p>
        </div>

        <p>Best regards,<br />The Rental House Management Team</p>

        <div class="footer">
            © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Rental House Management System
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>